{"text": "Je vous conseille ce livre.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MOI", "LIVRE", "CONSEILLER-À-VOUS"], "phenomena": ["directionnel"]}
{"text": "Nous vous expliquerons la suite.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["BIENTÔT", "NOUS", "SUITE", "EXPLIQUER-À-VOUS"], "phenomena": ["directionnel"]}
{"text": "Le live commence dans cinq minutes.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MINUTE", "CINQ", "DIRECT", "COMMENCER"], "phenomena": ["lexique-direct"]}
{"text": "Tu dois partir ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["TOI", "PARTIR", "DEVOIR", "QUESTION"], "phenomena": ["question-ouinon"]}
{"text": "Nous dînons à huit heures.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["HEURE", "HUIT", "NOUS", "DÎNER"], "phenomena": ["quotidien"]}
{"text": "Je ne connais pas cet homme.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MOI", "HOMME", "CONNAÎTRE", "NON"], "phenomena": ["negation"]}
{"text": "Du coup, on reste ici ce soir.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["SOIR", "ICI", "NOUS", "RESTER"], "phenomena": ["connecteur"]}
{"text": "Je bois un café chaque matin.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MATIN", "MOI", "CAFÉ", "BOIRE"], "phenomena": ["quotidien"]}
{"text": "À l'hôpital, les médecins sont très occupés.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["HÔPITAL", "MÉDECIN", "OCCUPÉ", "TRÈS"], "phenomena": ["lieu"]}
{"text": "Ce matin, nous avons lancé l'entraînement.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MATIN", "NOUS", "ENTRAÎNEMENT", "LANCER"], "phenomena": ["temps"]}
{"text": "Elle range ses livres.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["LUI", "LIVRE", "LUI", "RANGER"], "phenomena": ["possession"]}
{"text": "Elle leur raconte une histoire.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["LUI", "HISTOIRE", "RACONTER-À-EUX"], "phenomena": ["directionnel"]}
{"text": "Le batch size est petit.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["BATCH-SIZE", "PETIT"], "phenomena": ["verbatim-technique"]}
{"text": "Je ne sais pas.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MOI", "SAVOIR", "NON"], "phenomena": ["negation"]}
{"text": "Nous allons voter.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["BIENTÔT", "NOUS", "VOTER"], "phenomena": ["temps-futur"]}
{"text": "Je te montre mon nouveau téléphone.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MOI", "TÉLÉPHONE", "MOI", "NOUVEAU", "MONTRER-À-TOI"], "phenomena": ["directionnel"]}
{"text": "Vous aimez votre travail ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["VOUS", "TRAVAIL", "VOUS", "AIMER", "QUESTION"], "phenomena": ["possession"]}
{"text": "Que regardes-tu à la télévision ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["TÉLÉVISION", "TOI", "REGARDER", "QUOI"], "phenomena": ["question-ouverte"]}
{"text": "L'année prochaine, nous déménageons à Nantes.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["ANNÉE-PROCHAINE", "NANTES", "NOUS", "DÉMÉNAGER"], "phenomena": ["temps"]}
{"text": "La semaine prochaine, elle part en Italie.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["SEMAINE-PROCHAINE", "ITALIE", "LUI", "PARTIR"], "phenomena": ["temps"]}
{"text": "Notre réseau apprend vite.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["RÉSEAU", "NOUS", "APPRENDRE", "VITE"], "phenomena": ["possession"]}
{"text": "Le fine tuning améliore les résultats.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["FINE-TUNING", "RÉSULTAT", "AMÉLIORER"], "phenomena": ["domaine-ml"]}
{"text": "Pourquoi tu es en retard ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["TOI", "RETARD", "POURQUOI"], "phenomena": ["question-ouverte"]}
{"text": "Alors, tu as pris ta décision ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["AVANT", "TOI", "DÉCISION", "TOI", "PRENDRE", "QUESTION"], "phenomena": ["connecteur"]}
{"text": "Quand est-ce que vous arrivez ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["VOUS", "ARRIVER", "QUAND"], "phenomena": ["question-ouverte"]}
{"text": "Nous suivons l'élection en live.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["NOUS", "ÉLECTION", "SUIVRE", "DIRECT"], "phenomena": ["lexique-direct"]}
{"text": "Paul et Julie habitent à Nice.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["NICE", "PAUL", "JULIE", "HABITER"], "phenomena": ["verbatim-nom-propre"]}
{"text": "Combien d'heures dure l'entraînement ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["ENTRAÎNEMENT", "HEURE", "DURER", "COMBIEN"], "phenomena": ["question-ouverte"]}
{"text": "Tu lui réponds quand ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["TOI", "RÉPONDRE-À-LUI", "QUAND"], "phenomena": ["directionnel"]}
{"text": "Ils n'ont rien compris.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["AVANT", "EUX", "COMPRENDRE", "RIEN"], "phenomena": ["negation"]}
{"text": "Il m'a dit son secret.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["AVANT", "LUI", "SECRET", "LUI", "DIRE-À-MOI"], "phenomena": ["directionnel"]}
{"text": "Le machine learning transforme l'industrie.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MACHINE-LEARNING", "INDUSTRIE", "TRANSFORMER"], "phenomena": ["domaine-ml"]}
{"text": "Je veux te parler.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MOI", "PARLER-À-TOI", "VOULOIR"], "phenomena": ["modal"]}
{"text": "Le système détecte les signes en live.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["SYSTÈME", "SIGNE", "DÉTECTER", "DIRECT"], "phenomena": ["lexique-direct"]}
{"text": "Le magasin n'est pas ouvert.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MAGASIN", "OUVERT", "NON"], "phenomena": ["negation"]}
{"text": "Comment tu t'appelles ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["TOI", "APPELER", "COMMENT"], "phenomena": ["question-ouverte"]}
{"text": "Vous utilisez le GPU ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["VOUS", "GPU", "UTILISER", "QUESTION"], "phenomena": ["question-ouinon"]}
{"text": "Dans le bus, les gens dorment.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["BUS", "GENS", "DORMIR"], "phenomena": ["lieu"]}
{"text": "Que veut dire ce mot ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MOT", "VOULOIR-DIRE", "QUOI"], "phenomena": ["question-ouverte"]}
{"text": "Nous allons améliorer le modèle.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["BIENTÔT", "NOUS", "MODÈLE", "AMÉLIORER"], "phenomena": ["temps-futur"]}
{"text": "À la plage, les enfants jouent dans le sable.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["PLAGE", "ENFANT", "SABLE", "JOUER"], "phenomena": ["lieu"]}
{"text": "Le bus ne passe plus ici.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["ICI", "BUS", "PASSER", "NON"], "phenomena": ["negation"]}
{"text": "Demain, elle t'appelle.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["DEMAIN", "LUI", "APPELER-À-TOI"], "phenomena": ["directionnel"]}
{"text": "Le magasin ferme tard ?", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["MAGASIN", "FERMER", "TARD", "QUESTION"], "phenomena": ["question-ouinon"]}
{"text": "Je regarde Arte le soir.", "language": "fr", "glosses": ["SOIR", "MOI", "ARTE", "REGARDER"], "phenomena": ["verbatim-nom-propre"]}
